[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0010","text":"哦，甜花\n来得正好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0020","text":"上次拍摄的数据出来了\n要看看吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0030","text":"嗯……！\n谢谢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0040","text":"啊……小奈和千雪小姐的\n照片也有……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0050","text":"这样并排放在一起……\n总觉得，好棒……呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0060","text":"哈哈，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0070","text":"──是啊，ALSTROEMERIA"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0080","text":"嘿嘿……\n嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0090","text":"甜花，拍摄的时候……\n虽然有点没自信……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500300_02_0100","text":"三个人在一起的话……\n自信满满……！"}]
